<title>FRANCE: French govt no comment on Elf stake sale.</title>
<headline>French govt no comment on Elf stake sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French finance ministry declined to comment on Tuesday on the timing of the sale of its remaining stake in oil major Elf Aquitaine.</p>
<p>&quot;The state expects to sell this holding just like others but we have no comment to make on the timing of the sale,&quot; a ministry official said.</p>
<p>Elf shares have risen significantly recently as world oil prices have firmed. The state still holds 9.82 percent of the energy company.</p>
<p>Elf closed up 0.95 percent at 425.50 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 nm/pnt</p>
</text>
